'''Dondo''' is a [[Celebic language]] of [[Sulawesi]] in [[Indonesia]]. It is not clear how distinct it is from [[Tomini language|Tomini]]. It is spoken along the western coast of the "neck" of Sulawesi.<ref name="Himmelmann-Tomini">{{cite book |last=Himmelmann |first=Nikolaus P. |title=Sourcebook on Tomini-Tolitoli languages: General information and word lists |series=Pacific Linguistics |volume=511 |location=Canberra |publisher=The Australian National University |doi=10.15144/PL-511}}</ref>

